WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.398
Module three. Warehouses. Maal kahan se pick up hota hai, aur admin ko har pickup

2
00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:08.885
Address verify kyun karna padta hai.

3
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.399
Har S K U kisi warehouse mein hota hai, aur har order kisi warehouse se pick up hota

4
00:00:16.399 --> 00:00:20.310
Hai. Agar warehouse galat hai, toh baaki kuch kaam nahi karta.

5
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.833
Toh warehouses ko sahi se samajhte hain.

6
00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:25.203
Pehle, warehouses page.

7
00:00:25.653 --> 00:00:28.789
Phir naya warehouse add karna, field by field.

8
00:00:29.239 --> 00:00:33.143
Naya warehouse admin approval tak pending kyun rehta hai.

9
00:00:33.593 --> 00:00:38.543
Shiprocket mein pickup address verify karne ka naya agreed process.

10
00:00:38.993 --> 00:00:43.899
Aur har warehouse card ke buttons: pause intake, staff aur view inventory.

11
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.796
Ye vendor ka warehouses page hai.

12
00:00:49.246 --> 00:00:53.555
Active warehouses. Vendor ke paas kitni pickup locations hain.

13
00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:56.672
Capacity. Total jagah, square feet men.

14
00:00:57.122 --> 00:01:01.943
Open orders. Wo orders jo in warehouses se abhi fulfil hone hain.

15
00:01:02.393 --> 00:01:07.108
Total S K Us live. Wo products jo customers abhi kharid sakte hain.

16
00:01:07.558 --> 00:01:09.051
Add warehouse button.

17
00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:14.237
Aur har card pe status dikhta hai. Approved ka matlab ye bech sakta hai.

18
00:01:14.237 --> 00:01:17.395
Pending ka matlab ye admin ka wait kar raha hai.

19
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.320
Dekhne se pehle, add warehouse form ka har field.

20
00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:28.619
Pickup location name. Ek clear naam rakhiye, jaise city aur ek number.

21
00:01:28.619 --> 00:01:30.213
Ye unique hona chahiye.

22
00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:35.599
Full address aur pincode. Yahi wo exact address hai jahan courier aayega.

23
00:01:35.599 --> 00:01:38.236
Spelling aur pincode sahi hone chahiye.

24
00:01:38.686 --> 00:01:40.521
Capacity, square feet men.

25
00:01:40.971 --> 00:01:45.941
Opening aur closing time. Pickups sirf inhin hours mein schedule hote hain.

26
00:01:46.391 --> 00:01:51.334
Google Map pe exact location pin kijiye, ya Locate Me use kijiye.

27
00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:54.071
Pin ko asli entrance pe drag kijiye.

28
00:01:54.521 --> 00:01:59.705
Aur kaun si vehicles warehouse tak pahunch sakti hain, mini truck se trailer tak,

29
00:01:59.705 --> 00:02:01.497
Saath mein warehouse photos.

30
00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.545
Chaliye ise live demo mein dekhte hain.

31
00:02:09.533 --> 00:02:12.818
Ye live demo hai. Vendor Warehouses kholta hai.

32
00:02:16.733 --> 00:02:19.080
Aur Add warehouse pe click karta hai.

33
00:02:20.733 --> 00:02:26.045
Form khulta hai. Name, pincode, capacity, timings, map aur vehicle types.

34
00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:34.626
Vendor iska naam Gorakhpur one rakhta hai, address daalta hai, aur pincode two seven

35
00:02:34.626 --> 00:02:36.029
Three zero zero one.

36
00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:46.568
Opening time subah nine, closing time shaam six.

37
00:02:48.733 --> 00:02:53.957
Phir map pe pin. Tip kahta hai: map pe kahin bhi click kijiye ya pin ko exact

38
00:02:53.957 --> 00:02:56.264
Warehouse entrance pe drag kijiye.

39
00:02:57.533 --> 00:03:02.631
Agla, allowed vehicles. Mini truck, light commercial vehicle, medium aur heavy

40
00:03:02.631 --> 00:03:04.722
Commercial vehicle, aur trailer.

41
00:03:05.322 --> 00:03:08.288
Photos add hui, aur warehouse save ho gaya.

42
00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:14.226
Naya card, Gorakhpur one, sabse pehle dikhta hai, status pending ke saatha.

43
00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:16.290
Ye abhi orders nahi le sakta.

44
00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:30.906
Har card pe Pause Intake, Staff aur View inventory hai.

45
00:03:30.906 --> 00:03:33.170
In pe hum thodi der mein aayenge.

46
00:03:39.933 --> 00:03:45.629
Admin side pe, vendor ke details page pe har store aur warehouse ki list hoti hai.

47
00:03:46.079 --> 00:03:49.066
Ek pending warehouse, jaise Gorakhpur one.

48
00:03:49.516 --> 00:03:51.969
Admin ise approve kar sakta hai.

49
00:03:52.419 --> 00:03:56.238
Ya reject kar sakta hai, jaise agar address galat ho.

50
00:03:56.688 --> 00:04:01.782
Approve hone ke baad badge approved ho jaata hai, aur is warehouse ke products

51
00:04:01.782 --> 00:04:04.133
Nearby customers ko dikh sakte hain.

52
00:04:06.533 --> 00:04:11.441
Live session mein team ko ek asli problem mili, aur uska fix agree huaa.

53
00:04:11.441 --> 00:04:15.258
Ye zaroori hai, toh before aur after compare karte hain.

54
00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:21.003
Before. Warehouse approve hua, customer ne order kiya, aur vendor ne Shiprocket se

55
00:04:21.003 --> 00:04:26.168
Dispatch karne ki koshish ki. Lekin Shiprocket ne wo pickup address kabhi verify

56
00:04:26.168 --> 00:04:30.364
Nahi kiya tha, isliye vendor ko error dikha, aur order atak gaya.

57
00:04:30.814 --> 00:04:35.443
Now. Jab vendor warehouse add karta hai, admin ko notification jaata hai.

58
00:04:35.443 --> 00:04:40.325
Admin pehle Shiprocket mein pickup address verify karta hai, aur uske baad hi

59
00:04:40.325 --> 00:04:45.207
Warehouse approve karta hai. Toh jab tak koi order aata hai, address pehle se

60
00:04:45.207 --> 00:04:49.012
Verified hota hai, aur vendor ko wo error kabhi nahi dikhta.

61
00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:56.563
Admin Shiprocket mein pickup address exactly aise verify karta hai.

62
00:04:57.013 --> 00:05:00.149
Oribrix ka Shiprocket account login kijiye.

63
00:05:00.599 --> 00:05:01.836
Settings kholiye.

64
00:05:02.286 --> 00:05:04.014
Company Setup mein jaayiye.

65
00:05:04.464 --> 00:05:09.072
Pick Up Addresses kholiye. Naya warehouse yahan unverified dikhta hai.

66
00:05:09.522 --> 00:05:15.162
Verify pe click kijiye. Us pickup address ke registered phone number pe O T P jaata

67
00:05:15.162 --> 00:05:18.695
Hai. Use daaliye, aur address verified ho jaata hai.

68
00:05:19.145 --> 00:05:23.945
Uske baad hi admin panel mein vaapas jaakar warehouse approve kijiye.

69
00:05:26.333 --> 00:05:29.770
Ye session mein agree hua tha, isliye ise rule maaniye.

70
00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:34.519
Aisa warehouse kabhi approve mat kijiye jiska pickup address Shiprocket mein

71
00:05:34.519 --> 00:05:39.705
Verified nahi hai. Pehle verify, phir approve. Vendors ko pickup verification error

72
00:05:39.705 --> 00:05:43.954
Kabhi nahi dikhna chahiye. Agar dikhe, toh matlab ye step skip huaa.

73
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:24.047
Vaapas vendor side pe. Card pe View inventory us warehouse ka stock kholta hai.

74
00:06:24.497 --> 00:06:27.035
Is warehouse mein kitne S K Us hain.

75
00:06:27.485 --> 00:06:28.893
Total stock value.

76
00:06:29.343 --> 00:06:30.986
Kitne low stock pe hain.

77
00:06:31.436 --> 00:06:35.127
Aur har S K U, brand, stock aur price ke saatha.

78
00:06:37.533 --> 00:06:40.072
Har warehouse card pe kuch buttons hain.

79
00:06:40.522 --> 00:06:46.018
Pause Intake. Is warehouse ke items ko customers se temporarily chhupa deta hai.

80
00:06:46.018 --> 00:06:49.866
Holiday, stock count, ya shortage ke time kaam aata hai.

81
00:06:50.316 --> 00:06:55.521
Staff. Dikhata hai ki kaun se staff logins is warehouse pe kaam kar sakte hain.

82
00:06:55.971 --> 00:07:00.430
View inventory. Is warehouse ke S K Us aur stock dikhata hai.

83
00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:06.757
Edit, yaani pencil icon. Warehouse edit karne pe wo vaapas pending mein chala jaata

84
00:07:06.757 --> 00:07:09.306
Hai, taaki admin phir se check kare.

85
00:07:09.756 --> 00:07:13.404
Aur open ya closed, jo aaj ka status dikhata hai.

86
00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:20.597
Zyadatar warehouse problems laaparvahi se bhare form se shuru hoti hain.

87
00:07:20.597 --> 00:07:25.528
Save click karne se pehle vendor ko ye chhah cheezein check karni chahiye.

88
00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:31.688
Naam clear aur unique ho, jaise city aur ek number, taaki staff aur couriers ko pata

89
00:07:31.688 --> 00:07:32.911
Ho ki kaun sa hai.

90
00:07:33.361 --> 00:07:36.970
Address asli gate se match kare, landmark ke saatha.

91
00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.676
Couriers isi text ko follow karte hain.

92
00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:45.054
Pincode sahi ho. Galat pincode se Shiprocket pickup reject kar sakta hai.

93
00:07:45.504 --> 00:07:49.899
Map pin asli entrance pe drag ho, sirf city ke bich mein nahin.

94
00:07:50.349 --> 00:07:55.992
Opening aur closing time wahi hon jab staff sach mein maal hand over karne ke liye

95
00:07:55.992 --> 00:07:56.749
Maujood ho.

96
00:07:57.199 --> 00:08:02.687
Aur account pe phone number asli ho aur uthaya jaaye, kyunki O T Ps aur pickup

97
00:08:02.687 --> 00:08:04.516
Messages wahin jaate hain.

98
00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:12.481
Map pin decide karta hai ki vendor ka stock kin customers ko dikhega, aur courier

99
00:08:12.481 --> 00:08:17.097
Kahan jaayega. Ek achhe pin ko ek kharab pin se compare karte hain.

100
00:08:17.547 --> 00:08:21.634
Achha pin warehouse gate pe hota hai, address wale area mein hi.

101
00:08:21.634 --> 00:08:26.999
Nearby customers ko stock dikhta hai, aur courier pehli baar mein jagah dhoondh leta

102
00:08:26.999 --> 00:08:27.254
Hai.

103
00:08:27.704 --> 00:08:31.578
Kharab pin city centre mein hota hai, ya doosre city mein bhi.

104
00:08:31.578 --> 00:08:36.826
Address ek jagah batata hai aur pin doosri. Galat customers ko stock dikhta hai, aur

105
00:08:36.826 --> 00:08:41.825
Pickups fail ya delay hote hain. Admin ke roop mein warehouse review karte samay

106
00:08:41.825 --> 00:08:44.387
Hamesha pin ko address se compare kijiye.

107
00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:52.241
Jab koi bole ki customer app mein product nahi dikh raha, toh is list ko order mein

108
00:08:52.241 --> 00:08:53.093
Check kijiye.

109
00:08:53.543 --> 00:08:57.085
Kya warehouse approved hai? Pending warehouses nahi bechte.

110
00:08:57.535 --> 00:09:01.268
Kya intake paused hai? Toh items jaanboojhkar chhupe hain.

111
00:09:01.718 --> 00:09:06.262
Kya S K U stock mein hai? Out of stock items order nahi ho sakte.

112
00:09:06.712 --> 00:09:11.996
Kya customer is warehouse ke paas hai? Customers ko sirf nearby warehouses dikhte

113
00:09:11.996 --> 00:09:12.323
Hain.

114
00:09:12.773 --> 00:09:18.127
Aur kya vendor account suspended hai? Suspension hum module six mein cover karenge.

115
00:09:20.533 --> 00:09:24.954
Quick check. Ek vendor ne ten minutes pehle naya warehouse add kiya.

116
00:09:24.954 --> 00:09:28.205
Approve karne se pehle admin ko kya karna chahiye?

117
00:09:28.205 --> 00:09:28.725
Sochiye.

118
00:09:32.675 --> 00:09:38.186
Answer: Shiprocket mein pickup address verify karna, Settings, Company Setup, Pick

119
00:09:38.186 --> 00:09:40.270
Up Addresses men. Phir approve.

120
00:09:43.066 --> 00:09:48.587
Khatam karne se pehle, warehouse ke words ek baar phir, usi order mein jismen naya

121
00:09:48.587 --> 00:09:50.405
Warehouse inse guzarta hai.

122
00:09:50.855 --> 00:09:55.121
Pickup location. Warehouse ka wo address jahan courier aata hai.

123
00:09:55.571 --> 00:10:00.265
Pending. Warehouse save ho gaya hai, aur admin ke checks ka wait kar raha hai.

124
00:10:00.715 --> 00:10:05.707
Verified, Shiprocket men. Pickup address O T P se confirm ho chuka hai.

125
00:10:06.157 --> 00:10:09.997
Approved. Warehouse ab nearby customers ko bech sakta hai.

126
00:10:10.447 --> 00:10:16.097
Aur paused. Vendor ne abhi ke liye iske items chhupa diye hain, aur kabhi bhi resume

127
00:10:16.097 --> 00:10:17.039
Kar sakta hai.

128
00:10:19.433 --> 00:10:24.610
Ek aur check. Ek vendor ka warehouse Diwali ke liye teen din band rahega.

129
00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.518
Use kya karna chahiye? Ek second sochiye.

130
00:10:31.468 --> 00:10:35.836
Answer: pause intake kijiye, aur Diwali ke baad resume kijiye.

131
00:10:35.836 --> 00:10:41.260
Warehouse delete karne ya stock zero karne se extra kaam badhta hai, aur naye

132
00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:44.290
Warehouse ko phir se approval chahiye hoga.

133
00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.596
Module three ko summarise karte hain.

134
00:10:50.046 --> 00:10:54.057
Warehouse ek exact pickup address hai, map pin ke saatha.

135
00:10:54.507 --> 00:10:57.963
Naya ya edit kiya hua warehouse pending hota hai.

136
00:10:58.413 --> 00:11:02.701
Admin pehle Shiprocket mein pickup address verify karta hai.

137
00:11:03.151 --> 00:11:05.732
Phir admin warehouse approve karta hai.

138
00:11:06.182 --> 00:11:09.812
Aur pause intake items ko temporarily chhupata hai.

139
00:11:09.812 --> 00:11:12.945
Agla, module four mein, orders aur dispatch.

140
00:11:15.333 --> 00:11:20.837
Module 3 yahin khatam hota hai. Agla hai module 4: Orders and dispatch.
